WEBVTT

00:21.187 --> 00:24.054
Punie, listen to me very carefully.

00:24.157 --> 00:25.351
Yes, Mama.

00:25.725 --> 00:29.422
Starting today, you're going
to spend a year living on Earth.

00:29.529 --> 00:33.693
I'm sure there will be many
difficult tasks ahead for you.

00:33.800 --> 00:37.634
But you must find a way
to overcome those things. Because...

00:37.737 --> 00:41.104
If you get lonely,
you can always come back...

00:42.275 --> 00:44.869
No need to say
such unnecessary things.

00:45.111 --> 00:47.136
Oh, but I'm fine.

00:47.247 --> 00:50.774
I mean, this is a test
to become the next queen!

00:51.418 --> 00:53.443
Now, that's my daughter.

00:53.820 --> 00:56.880
Punie!

01:02.362 --> 01:04.956
I'm going now, Papa, Mama.

01:05.231 --> 01:06.357
Go!

01:11.638 --> 01:16.405
I'm Punie Tanaka, a transfer from
Saint Magic Academy up in the sky!

01:17.177 --> 01:19.077
Nice to meet you!

01:29.589 --> 01:31.079
Anego.

01:36.529 --> 01:38.292
I don't like it.

01:39.065 --> 01:42.592
Seducing men like
that and being conceited.

01:45.772 --> 01:48.400
That's the type I hate the most.

01:49.008 --> 01:52.102
Should we teach her a good lesson?

01:53.880 --> 01:54.972
Ashtray.

02:03.022 --> 02:05.047
Mind your own business.

02:06.559 --> 02:08.618
I'll do it myself!

02:08.862 --> 02:11.353
Hey, you need to keep it quiet.

02:11.464 --> 02:12.829
Shut up!

02:14.200 --> 02:15.428
Ouch...

02:20.373 --> 02:22.000
Why?

02:32.819 --> 02:35.913
<i>Magical Witch Punie- chan</i>

02:36.089 --> 02:39.024
<i>Spin that Princess Rod.</i>

02:39.359 --> 02:42.260
<i>She has descended
from the land of magic.</i>

02:42.629 --> 02:45.723
<i>Spin that magical stick.</i>

02:45.865 --> 02:48.834
<i>Pleased to meet you, Punie Tanaka.</i>

02:49.068 --> 02:55.496
<i>Lightning, sweep, exterminate,
use your powers and rule the world.</i>

02:55.675 --> 03:00.442
<i>Don't trust those kind
words and nice smiles.</i>

03:03.883 --> 03:09.617
<i>Lyrical Tokarev, kill them all.</i>

03:09.956 --> 03:16.555
<i>I will take you to the land of paradise.</i>

03:16.829 --> 03:22.927
<i>Lyrical Tokarev, kill them all.</i>

03:23.036 --> 03:31.808
<i>There's only one way
to survive, and that is to fight.</i>

03:39.385 --> 03:50.489
<i>There's only one path that leads
to supremacy, and that is by fighting.</i>

03:54.234 --> 03:57.692
<i>Episode 1: Miracle Rod Causes
a Huge Panic at the School Festival!?</i>

03:57.804 --> 04:00.705
<i>Magical Princess
Punie- chan Appears!!</i>

04:01.140 --> 04:02.334
Wow!

04:03.509 --> 04:05.875
What a perfectly clear sky!

04:05.979 --> 04:09.107
Earth is such a really clean place!

04:09.515 --> 04:12.541
I really like this place!

04:13.786 --> 04:14.621
So cute...

04:14.621 --> 04:16.486
So cute...
She's so innocent.

04:16.589 --> 04:20.116
These beautiful
forests, land, and skies.

04:21.694 --> 04:26.097
When I become
the queen, they'll all be mine!

04:29.669 --> 04:33.435
Hey, what are you
grinning about? You disgust me.

04:36.509 --> 04:39.740
Making eye contact with
the guys and getting their attention.

04:40.213 --> 04:44.741
You must be very pleased, miss.

04:45.184 --> 04:47.812
Oh, that was a charm spell.

04:48.087 --> 04:50.112
Every girl has it.

04:52.492 --> 04:55.928
You're very pretty, so you can
probably use a wonderful charm.

04:58.431 --> 04:59.864
Why you...

05:03.436 --> 05:05.028
You wanna fight?

05:10.710 --> 05:15.272
Lyrical Tokarev, kill them all!

05:27.160 --> 05:30.755
Powers of the earth,
please protect me!

05:45.945 --> 05:47.139
What are they?

05:47.246 --> 05:49.043
Stop picking on Punie-chan!

05:49.148 --> 05:50.274
Take that!

05:50.616 --> 05:51.984
Anego, they're pretty tasty.

05:51.984 --> 05:53.542
Anego, they're pretty tasty.
I'm still raw!

05:57.090 --> 06:00.389
Don't get carried away
just because you can use magic!

06:03.529 --> 06:05.929
Carrot! Potato!
Cabbage! Cucumber! Onion!

06:06.032 --> 06:07.932
Garlic! Melon! Eggplant! Pumpkin!

06:08.034 --> 06:09.433
Corn! Burdock! Chinese cabbage!

06:09.535 --> 06:11.901
Sakurajima radish! Broccoli!
Goya! Japanese yam!

06:45.872 --> 06:49.569
<i>Life expectancy
for humans is 50 years</i>

06:53.413 --> 06:54.846
Wow! Amazing!

06:54.914 --> 06:55.437
Yes!

06:55.515 --> 06:58.117
It's like they're welcoming
you with their blessings.

06:58.117 --> 06:58.518
<i>110th School Festival</i>

06:58.518 --> 07:00.520
<i>110th School Festival
So, this is the school festival.</i>

07:00.520 --> 07:02.078
<i>110th School Festival
So many stands!</i>

07:02.288 --> 07:06.247
I came at a really perfect time.
Earth has such interesting customs.

07:06.359 --> 07:09.760
If I become queen, maybe
I'll establish a magic school here.

07:10.163 --> 07:12.188
What the hell is this?

07:12.598 --> 07:15.328
You people trying to kill us?

07:15.435 --> 07:18.233
Everyone, their curry
has cockroaches in it!

07:18.337 --> 07:21.602
I can't eat this stuff, you idiot!

07:22.442 --> 07:26.105
What? We try hard to make
our food sanitary. This can't be...

07:26.212 --> 07:28.237
There must be
some misunderstanding!

07:28.347 --> 07:30.747
This was in your curry!

07:32.485 --> 07:34.817
All right, trash this place!

07:34.921 --> 07:35.755
Yeah!

07:35.755 --> 07:37.382
Yeah!
What'll you trash?

07:37.490 --> 07:40.050
You know. We'll turn
this place upside down...

07:41.160 --> 07:42.491
You...

07:43.329 --> 07:45.024
Well, you see...

07:45.932 --> 07:46.899
Let's go!

07:46.999 --> 07:47.988
Right.

07:50.136 --> 07:54.095
I don't know who you are,
but thank you very much!

07:54.207 --> 07:55.508
What happened?

07:55.508 --> 07:55.975
<i>Railroad Research Committee's
Famous Curry- It's delicious!</i>

07:55.975 --> 07:59.604
<i>Railroad Research Committee's
Famous Curry- It's delicious!
For some reason,
that group targets and harasses me.</i>

07:59.712 --> 08:02.078
As a result, no one buys from us.

08:02.181 --> 08:03.910
I'm sorry to hear that.

08:04.450 --> 08:08.648
I'll be your customer.
Can I have an order of curry?

08:12.258 --> 08:14.954
We have an order! One curry please!

08:15.061 --> 08:16.028
Coming!

08:16.896 --> 08:18.454
Thanks for waiting.

08:18.798 --> 08:21.858
Wow, looks delicious! Bon appétit!

08:21.968 --> 08:26.132
Turmeric, cumin seed, chili powder,
cardamom, clove, and others.

08:26.372 --> 08:29.102
Curry is filled with lots of spices.

08:29.208 --> 08:31.642
How is the taste, miss?

08:33.446 --> 08:35.607
Get me the store owner.

08:39.252 --> 08:40.776
This isn't curry.

08:43.489 --> 08:45.047
It's yellow feed.

08:45.825 --> 08:46.917
So mean!

08:47.026 --> 08:52.054
The temperature, quality, and spices'
scent... Aren't they the same as ever?

08:52.164 --> 08:55.497
If you made it according
to recipe, it's just ridiculous.

08:55.601 --> 08:59.128
It's a typical, awful curry
made by an amateur.

08:59.272 --> 09:00.762
Hey, hey, hey!

09:00.873 --> 09:04.206
Boss!

09:07.613 --> 09:11.845
Lyrical Tokarev, kill them all!

09:19.559 --> 09:22.153
You don't have to depend
on popular spices.

09:22.261 --> 09:25.822
You love the railroad, so there's
a curry only you can make.

09:25.932 --> 09:30.062
A curry that only I can make?

09:36.742 --> 09:39.802
I know. I can use that method.

09:39.912 --> 09:41.937
Boss, it'll work if it's that.

09:42.048 --> 09:44.778
You're right.
Let's do a good job, everyone.

09:44.917 --> 09:46.248
Yeah!

09:46.352 --> 09:50.089
But I wonder why Anego and
her gang want to harass her?

09:50.089 --> 09:52.523
<i>Maiden Curry Hall</i>

09:54.093 --> 09:56.527
We don't have any customers.

09:56.629 --> 09:58.563
Should I go fetch a few?

10:00.399 --> 10:02.765
Why don't you try some curry?

10:06.205 --> 10:07.807
It's really good though.

10:07.807 --> 10:09.297
It's really good though.
Does this mean...

10:09.375 --> 10:12.708
...that we're not maidens?

10:12.812 --> 10:15.804
What are you saying?
You're one fine maiden!

10:15.915 --> 10:18.213
You made such good curry.

10:18.451 --> 10:22.182
Damn... If it wasn't
for that magical pendant...

10:24.557 --> 10:28.391
I see. So that magical
pendant is getting in your way?

10:28.828 --> 10:29.795
Who're you?

10:29.895 --> 10:32.455
If you're in here,
you better order something.

10:32.632 --> 10:39.435
What if I told you this statue of the evil
god Anisakis could inhibit her magic?

10:40.373 --> 10:43.274
If she had no magic,
we wouldn't be afraid of her.

10:43.376 --> 10:47.335
We'd give her a beating and send
her back to the land of magic.

10:47.446 --> 10:50.643
Is that right? Then I shall give you this.

10:50.816 --> 10:52.181
Okay.

10:53.719 --> 10:56.187
Bad news!
The railroad-research curry is...

10:57.056 --> 10:58.717
Give me some curry!

10:58.824 --> 10:59.916
Hurry!

11:00.926 --> 11:02.553
What's going on?

11:05.197 --> 11:09.429
This seems like ordinary curry,
but what is this strange nostalgia?

11:09.769 --> 11:14.206
This container isn't an ordinary one...
Seven hundred... Three hundred...

11:14.907 --> 11:16.067
This is...

11:16.175 --> 11:18.075
The old bullet train!

11:18.344 --> 11:22.508
Yes, this is the long-lost flavor
of the bullet train buffet curry!

11:22.782 --> 11:27.515
But this isn't just a recreation!
The stars are these vegetables!

11:27.720 --> 11:31.156
How fresh and juicy!
These vegetables are alive!

11:31.624 --> 11:35.321
The vegetables are alive?
Not good. Where are they making it?

11:35.428 --> 11:37.862
The home ec room. What'll you do?

11:37.963 --> 11:41.558
You know! Did you forget
how I take care of things?

11:49.675 --> 11:52.200
Can we become delicious curry?

11:52.311 --> 11:53.869
Well, let's go!

11:53.979 --> 11:55.173
Yeah!

11:55.815 --> 11:56.975
What's wrong?

11:57.083 --> 11:59.643
I'm kind of afraid to jump in...

11:59.952 --> 12:02.614
Shameful... Bring me the peeler!

12:02.722 --> 12:03.848
Yes, sir!

12:05.291 --> 12:09.193
Isn't this the time to repay
Punie-sama for her great gratitude?

12:09.295 --> 12:11.422
Why should you hesitate?

12:15.668 --> 12:17.795
He's peeling his own skin!

12:19.839 --> 12:23.798
Carrot-dono, I'm sorry,
but where is the pot?

12:23.909 --> 12:25.706
You can't see?

12:25.811 --> 12:28.939
Carrot-dono, we veggies
have to show mercy.

12:30.382 --> 12:31.349
Sorry!

12:34.887 --> 12:35.955
See you later.

12:35.955 --> 12:36.956
See you later.
Potato-dono!

12:36.956 --> 12:38.753
Potato-dono!

12:41.393 --> 12:43.452
We'll be joining you shortly!

12:43.562 --> 12:47.123
The vegetables really are alive.
She's a witch after all...

12:47.533 --> 12:50.263
I'll destroy them. This curry is evil!

12:50.369 --> 12:52.037
Please don't do that.

12:52.037 --> 12:52.833
Please don't do that.
Punie!

12:52.905 --> 12:55.999
I'll have to use a punishment
spell on people like you.

12:56.108 --> 12:59.839
Lyrical Tokarev, kill them all!

12:59.945 --> 13:00.969
Take this!

13:01.981 --> 13:04.916
That's a statue of Anisakis!
Where'd you get that?

13:05.017 --> 13:08.680
That's none of your business.
I suppressed your magic now.

13:08.788 --> 13:10.653
Gang, beat her up!

13:10.756 --> 13:12.053
Yeah!

13:12.191 --> 13:15.786
What should I do?
I can't use my Princess Rod.

13:16.695 --> 13:17.563
Then...

13:17.563 --> 13:19.326
Then...
I'll give you some pain!

13:19.765 --> 13:23.326
Then I'll have to respond
by getting physical!

13:23.435 --> 13:24.663
Die!

13:25.638 --> 13:28.004
Princess Arm Lock!

13:29.208 --> 13:31.142
You little bitch!

13:32.278 --> 13:35.008
Princess Choke Sleeper!

13:37.883 --> 13:40.044
Princess Foot Lock!

13:41.353 --> 13:43.446
Princess Americana!

13:43.722 --> 13:46.418
Princess Guillotine Choke Sleeper!

13:46.625 --> 13:50.083
W-What's with those simple
but painful-looking moves?

13:50.196 --> 13:51.527
Striking...

13:53.866 --> 13:56.266
Striking is unnecessary in a fight.

13:56.368 --> 13:56.735
Effective

13:56.735 --> 13:58.804
Effective
A champion uses submission holds.

13:58.804 --> 13:59.771
A champion uses submission holds.

14:05.344 --> 14:06.368
Princess...

14:06.478 --> 14:09.709
No! I don't like painful ones!

14:10.783 --> 14:12.648
...Achilles Hold!

14:22.061 --> 14:25.224
Oops, I did it again.

14:29.869 --> 14:32.463
I knew a girl gang leader couldn't do it.

14:32.571 --> 14:35.062
Stopping the trials is hard.

14:36.408 --> 14:38.171
Oh, what's wrong?

14:38.277 --> 14:40.973
We can't sell any of our baked squid.

14:41.080 --> 14:42.570
I'm sorry!

14:42.681 --> 14:46.777
Leave it to me. I'll give you
the best baked squid in the world.

14:46.886 --> 14:51.380
Lyrical Tokarev, kill them all!

14:51.690 --> 14:52.791
It's a monster squid!

14:52.791 --> 14:54.952
It's a monster squid!
My son's still in the building!

14:55.060 --> 14:56.220
Help me!

14:56.328 --> 14:57.454
Boss!

14:59.865 --> 15:00.923
Oops.

15:04.536 --> 15:09.030
No, I'll be late. Watching "Goodbye,
Blue Train Morning Breeze, Sakura"...

15:09.141 --> 15:11.176
...on DVD so late was a mistake.

15:11.176 --> 15:12.370
...on DVD so late was a mistake.
Excuse me...

15:12.478 --> 15:14.079
Sorry, I'm in a rush!

15:14.079 --> 15:16.877
Sorry, I'm in a rush!
Do you have anything to eat?

15:19.418 --> 15:22.910
Oh no! Take my special
"assorted bento from the peak."

15:23.022 --> 15:24.011
Wow!

15:25.357 --> 15:26.847
Delicious, paya!

15:26.959 --> 15:30.554
Thank you, paya.
I don't know how to thank you.

15:30.663 --> 15:32.062
You're welcome.

15:32.164 --> 15:33.632
Pa
I'm Payatan.

15:33.632 --> 15:35.361
Pa
I'm from the land of magic.

15:35.467 --> 15:36.268
Magic?

15:36.268 --> 15:37.394
Magic?
Right, paya.

15:37.503 --> 15:39.937
I came to find my master, paya.

15:40.039 --> 15:42.098
Good morning, Tetsuko-chan!

15:42.207 --> 15:43.075
Good morning.

15:43.075 --> 15:45.168
Good morning.
P-P-Punie-sama!

15:46.278 --> 15:47.245
Payatan!

15:47.346 --> 15:48.580
Punie-sama!

15:48.580 --> 15:50.514
Punie-sama!
Payatan!

15:52.985 --> 15:57.354
Why did you leave without saying
a word? Don't you like me anymore?

15:57.723 --> 16:00.157
It's not like that, Payatan.

16:00.259 --> 16:03.160
It was hard to say goodbye,
so I left without a word.

16:03.395 --> 16:04.555
Punie-sama!

16:04.663 --> 16:06.096
Payatan!

16:06.699 --> 16:11.659
<i>Episode 2: Playful and
Cute Mascot Payatan Appears!!</i>

16:11.804 --> 16:16.264
So a mascot always stays with
the witch in the land of magic?

16:16.375 --> 16:17.364
Right, paya.

16:17.476 --> 16:20.934
But you shouldn't have
followed me when I'm in training.

16:21.046 --> 16:23.139
Mama might get mad at you.

16:23.248 --> 16:26.445
It's fine, paya.
I want to be with you even so.

16:26.552 --> 16:27.519
Jeez.

16:28.287 --> 16:31.017
You two get along very well.

16:31.123 --> 16:34.149
I want a mascot like Payatan too.

16:34.259 --> 16:38.389
You should go to Exciting Mascot
Village. Many of my friends are there.

16:38.630 --> 16:42.327
"Exciting Mascot Village"?
Sounds like fun!

16:42.835 --> 16:47.829
I still remember when I went to see
Payatan at Exciting Mascot Village.

16:47.940 --> 16:48.907
Paya.

16:49.875 --> 16:52.867
<i>Exciting Mascot Village</i>

17:04.023 --> 17:07.220
Go away!
You're obstructing my business!

17:07.659 --> 17:10.184
There! All right, 4, 5, 6!

17:10.396 --> 17:13.661
And this broad was really something.

17:21.273 --> 17:23.298
Who the hell are you?

17:23.976 --> 17:25.841
I came to get a mascot.

17:27.780 --> 17:30.874
A mascot! I didn't know
dumb witches were around!

17:30.983 --> 17:33.850
There's no one here
that you can handle.

17:33.952 --> 17:36.978
Did you mix this up with
the south's "Cheery Mascot Village"?

17:37.089 --> 17:40.217
This place is only full of guys like us!

17:41.226 --> 17:42.784
Ow, ow, ow...

17:43.495 --> 17:46.828
Don't get me wrong.
My business isn't with you lowlives.

17:47.099 --> 17:49.090
Let go! You'll break my arm!

17:49.201 --> 17:51.999
If you don't let go,
you'll be in big trouble!

17:55.207 --> 17:58.665
I broke it.
Now, what kind of trouble am I in?

17:58.877 --> 18:00.208
You bitch!

18:01.213 --> 18:02.373
Stop it.

18:04.450 --> 18:06.850
You're no match for her.

18:06.952 --> 18:07.352
Bro...

18:07.352 --> 18:08.580
Bro...
Bro Payatan...

18:08.687 --> 18:09.745
Move.

18:09.855 --> 18:14.315
You're Payatan? Your fame
has reached our kingdom as well.

18:14.426 --> 18:17.190
Booze
Bartender, get me the usual.

18:18.530 --> 18:19.656
Got it.

18:20.466 --> 18:22.434
<i>Coffee Milk</i>

18:27.005 --> 18:28.472
Listen, miss.

18:29.808 --> 18:32.606
This is a place to drink and have fun.

18:33.312 --> 18:38.716
If you have eyes as shiny as a sword,
you won't live very long in this village.

18:38.817 --> 18:43.777
You should get out of this village
and confine yourself in some city.

18:46.859 --> 18:51.319
It's for the best, but I guess
you didn't come here to talk after all.

18:55.901 --> 18:57.095
Step outside.

19:03.775 --> 19:06.266
Be my mascot, Payatan.

19:06.678 --> 19:09.112
You'll have a successful future.

19:09.982 --> 19:13.315
I'm not really good at serving people.

19:13.418 --> 19:17.115
Well, grumbling about
this and that won't do anything.

19:17.456 --> 19:21.984
If you want to make me your mascot,
defeat me. That's the rule.

19:22.194 --> 19:23.320
Fine!

19:26.498 --> 19:28.659
Princess Kneebar!

19:31.036 --> 19:32.003
Paya.

19:33.338 --> 19:35.363
Princess V1 Armlock!

19:36.408 --> 19:37.170
Paya.

19:37.276 --> 19:39.369
Princess Camel Clutch!

19:41.380 --> 19:42.472
Paya.

19:48.520 --> 19:51.887
Sorry, but my body is rather unique.

19:51.990 --> 19:56.893
Every joint moves 360 degrees,
so submission holds won't work.

19:57.696 --> 20:00.028
Somebody, contact her kingdom.

20:00.132 --> 20:03.260
She won't be able to move
on her own for a while.

20:03.368 --> 20:06.132
Don't think it's over yet.

20:09.107 --> 20:13.009
I really like you now.
You'll make a perfect servant.

20:14.079 --> 20:16.047
You're gonna die, miss.

20:18.150 --> 20:21.483
Defeat is the same
as death in the royal family.

20:23.222 --> 20:25.281
Princess Headlock!

20:26.725 --> 20:30.684
Jeez, I thought you'd use some
amazing move, but a headlock?

20:30.796 --> 20:33.594
It's nothing special,
and I'm disappointed.

20:33.699 --> 20:37.100
A headlock is nothing
special? You're so naive.

20:37.202 --> 20:38.169
What?

20:43.609 --> 20:44.974
No way! He's in pain!

20:45.077 --> 20:45.811
Impossible!

20:45.811 --> 20:46.812
Impossible!
His head can smash huge rocks!

20:46.812 --> 20:48.439
His head can smash huge rocks!

20:48.547 --> 20:50.845
You should do your homework.

20:51.350 --> 20:54.786
The skull has a juncture.
Which means it has a joint.

20:54.886 --> 20:59.846
Headlocks use that to directly attack
the brain, a deadly submission hold.

21:00.025 --> 21:03.222
It feels like someone's
grabbing my brain...

21:03.562 --> 21:05.826
A champion uses submission holds.

21:05.931 --> 21:08.900
There are no holds
that I can't master!

21:11.803 --> 21:13.065
He's been beaten!

21:13.171 --> 21:14.229
Let's flee!

21:14.539 --> 21:18.305
Now, keep your promise.
Be my mascot.

21:19.511 --> 21:21.103
You'll regret it...

21:21.713 --> 21:24.876
When you sleep... When you eat...

21:26.251 --> 21:30.244
I can promise you that
you'll never feel safe again!

21:30.355 --> 21:33.085
I'm definitely going to kill you!

21:37.796 --> 21:39.058
What's so funny?

21:40.832 --> 21:45.235
If I can't handle one or two
servants who are after my life...

21:45.337 --> 21:47.805
...how can I call myself royalty?

21:48.373 --> 21:50.534
You're a strange princess.

21:50.642 --> 21:53.304
Take out your mascot contract.

21:58.350 --> 22:03.947
This life that I have...
I swear to serve you as long as I live.

22:11.263 --> 22:13.098
We've been friends ever since, right?

22:13.098 --> 22:14.156
We've been friends ever since, right?
Right?

22:14.266 --> 22:15.790
Let's go to school!

22:15.901 --> 22:17.300
Let's go, paya!

22:17.436 --> 22:18.528
Let's go!

22:18.637 --> 22:19.934
Go, paya!

22:21.573 --> 22:25.532
They've gone through a lot,
but they get along now, so...

22:28.980 --> 22:30.449
What's wrong, Tetsuko-chan?

22:30.449 --> 22:32.144
What's wrong, Tetsuko-chan?
What is it, paya?

22:32.250 --> 22:33.478
It's nothing!

22:33.585 --> 22:35.177
He's after her!

22:35.287 --> 22:37.721
He's still itching to kill her!

22:38.023 --> 22:40.924
We're going to be late! Let's hurry!

22:41.026 --> 22:42.186
Paya!

22:44.563 --> 22:47.054
I didn't use any magic this time, did I?

22:47.165 --> 22:49.190
You don't need any magic.

22:49.301 --> 22:51.394
Oh, Anego-san. You're alive?

22:51.503 --> 22:53.403
I'm not dead yet!

22:53.872 --> 22:54.839
Hehe.

22:54.940 --> 22:57.340
<i>To Be Continued</i>

23:14.493 --> 23:22.332
<i>If you bend the knees upside down...</i>

23:22.601 --> 23:29.837
<i>...even your belief about
crushing a rock becomes distorted.</i>

23:30.609 --> 23:38.106
<i>Good, justice, and even the truth
is gone when you feel the pain.</i>

23:38.216 --> 23:46.624
<i>Even those with fortitude have joints.</i>

23:46.758 --> 23:54.631
<i>Take a look. This is
the submission of a monarch.</i>

23:54.833 --> 24:07.212
<i>As long as you
have fortitude, you will prosper.</i>

24:28.200 --> 24:32.000
Next Magical Witch Punie-chan,
"Shocking Breakfast Strategy?"

24:32.103 --> 24:34.537
"If a Little Cuckoo
Doesn't Chirp, Kill It!"

24:34.639 --> 24:39.542
<i>"Oh, So Cute! Did You Know the
Chances of Having Twins Are 1l120?"</i>

24:39.644 --> 24:41.703
Please look forward to it!
